<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria Vitafoam turnover up, pretax eases.</title>
<headline>Nigeria Vitafoam turnover up, pretax eases.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month result to end-June, 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>Turnover			   1,000   vs  710</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	   123.3 vs  127.3</p>
<p>Taxation				39.4 vs   47.1</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	     83.8 vs   80.2</p>
<p>Full name is Vitafoam Nigeria Plc.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
